  "abilities": [],
  "behavior": "It patrols different areas and attacks when it detects a threat. Its combat is entirely melee-based, using strikes and short combos to maintain close-range pressure. It normally appears in groups with other C.K.U. units and CHOP.R robots.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "On its own it is rarely a major threat, but several together can become quite annoying. In the Abyss outside laboratories, you can usually ignore them and keep moving, while on solid ground their pursuit can interfere much more with exploration.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "It is often found alongside other C.K.U. and CHOP.R units, forming small robot groups that can enter combat almost simultaneously once they detect a threat.",
  "strategy": "Use Busting damage and aim for the vent if you decide to fight it. In the Abyss, it is usually not worth spending time or resources clearing the group; dodging them and moving on is generally better. On solid ground, if several begin chasing you, killing them before continuing exploration may prevent repeated interruptions.",
